1
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:03,100
"Kiss or Kill"

2
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:06,000
(Episode 1)

3
00:01:52,359 --> 00:01:55,280
I've been waiting a long time for you.

4
00:01:56,239 --> 00:01:57,239
President Zhao.

5
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:59,160
Sorry to keep you waiting.

6
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:02,760
What are you doing here?

7
00:02:03,359 --> 00:02:05,280
Where's that old geezer Lin Cang?

8
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,719
My uncle is tied up with business today.

9
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:09,319
He couldn't make it.

10
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,000
Tied up?

11
00:02:12,199 --> 00:02:13,159
I think he's just...

12
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:14,960
refusing to show me any respect.

13
00:02:17,199 --> 00:02:18,759
You're overthinking it, President Zhao.

14
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:21,718
My uncle specifically asked me...

15
00:02:21,719 --> 00:02:22,759
to apologize to you.

16
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,400
Apologize?

17
00:02:32,639 --> 00:02:33,959
A loyal client I've worked with...

18
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:35,318
for over a decade...

19
00:02:35,319 --> 00:02:37,080
and you just poached them like that.

20
00:02:38,479 --> 00:02:40,199
Bringing this piece of junk here...

21
00:02:40,879 --> 00:02:42,199
Do you take me for a beggar?

22
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:44,600
Can you even afford to
make amends for this?

23
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:48,080
President Zhao.

24
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:52,680
This industry is about business.

25
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:54,039
Not friendship.

26
00:02:54,639 --> 00:02:57,319
You're still offering outdated goods.

27
00:02:58,159 --> 00:03:01,280
We have the latest kits in our hands.

28
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:03,120
If you were the buyer...

29
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:05,360
who would you choose?

30
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:09,599
Cut the shit.

31
00:03:09,919 --> 00:03:10,919
Do you believe...

32
00:03:11,159 --> 00:03:12,919
I'll cut off your routes down south?

33
00:03:17,879 --> 00:03:21,479
You know the connections behind my uncle well.

34
00:03:22,599 --> 00:03:24,280
Cutting off Lin's source of wealth...

35
00:03:24,719 --> 00:03:26,800
isn't that just cutting
off your own lifeline?

36
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,280
My uncle said...

37
00:03:28,599 --> 00:03:31,840
from now on, Lin will move
the goods in your hands.

38
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:33,560
Compared to doing it yourself...

39
00:03:34,080 --> 00:03:36,439
you'll only make a profit, no losses.

40
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:41,119
That old fox Lin Cang...

41
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:42,680
sure has a big appetite.

42
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:45,240
Daring to play monopoly
in this line of work.

43
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:48,000
Careful, a tall tree catches the wind.

44
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:51,240
A tall tree does catch the wind.

45
00:03:51,759 --> 00:03:52,840
But President Zhao...

46
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:56,319
it's nice to enjoy the
shade under a big tree.

47
00:04:07,759 --> 00:04:08,759
Scared?

48
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:18,000
This is just the beginning.

49
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:31,720
Who the hell do you think you are?

50
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:34,759
It's not your place to speak.

51
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:36,799
Do you believe I could...

52
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:37,959
shoot you dead right now?

53
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:39,279
Come on.

54
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:40,600
Come on, shoot right here.

55
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:50,120
President Zhao.

56
00:04:50,279 --> 00:04:52,399
I'll take that hit just now.

57
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:55,439
But the partnership my uncle proposed...

58
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:57,399
you should still consider it.

59
00:04:58,040 --> 00:04:59,040
Otherwise...

60
00:04:59,279 --> 00:05:00,000
I can't guarantee...

61
00:05:00,001 --> 00:05:01,079
You guarantee?

62
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:05,039
When I was on the border...

63
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:06,480
running guns...

64
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:09,319
you were just a little orphan
mutt whose parents just died.

65
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:11,159
How dare you rely on the Lin Group...

66
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:12,479
to bark in front of me.

67
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:13,920
Who do you think you are?

68
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:17,360
Get lost!

69
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,360
Good dog.

70
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:58,920
Don't rush.

71
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:01,680
There's something even more exciting.

72
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:11,800
Bite down hard.

73
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:37,600
That's enough.

74
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:39,280
Come up and make the arrest.

75
00:06:45,879 --> 00:06:47,119
What crimes you've committed...

76
00:06:47,279 --> 00:06:48,399
you know very well yourself.

77
00:06:49,959 --> 00:06:51,439
Go confess to the police.

78
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:58,600
Liar! Come back!

79
00:06:58,800 --> 00:07:01,439
Liar! You come back!

80
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:05,680
Him laying a hand on you...

81
00:07:05,681 --> 00:07:07,241
is a slap in the face to the Lin Group.

82
00:07:07,279 --> 00:07:08,719
I'll skin him alive sooner or later.

83
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:12,800
Go ahead.

84
00:07:13,399 --> 00:07:14,759
You had this planned all along...?

85
00:07:15,199 --> 00:07:16,199
Did you think...

86
00:07:16,399 --> 00:07:17,800
I'd just let Lin lose face?

87
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:37,935
Running off right after the mission.

88
00:07:37,959 --> 00:07:38,959
Not even saying hello.

89
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:40,255
I have a date with a stunner.

90
00:07:40,279 --> 00:07:41,279
I'm running late.

91
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:42,878
The dazzling world is waiting for me.

92
00:07:42,879 --> 00:07:44,719
I envy your free lifestyle.

93
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:46,759
But you really go all out.

94
00:07:47,160 --> 00:07:48,120
To catch this guy...

95
00:07:48,121 --> 00:07:49,559
you even put yourself on the line.

96
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:50,839
As long as it pays.

97
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:52,800
Is that so?

98
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:54,438
How come I heard...

99
00:07:54,439 --> 00:07:55,959
you originally turned down this job...

100
00:07:56,079 --> 00:07:57,679
but when you found out A-kun...

101
00:07:57,680 --> 00:07:58,680
not only trades information...

102
00:07:58,681 --> 00:07:59,839
but also traffics kids...

103
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:01,639
you took the job back?

104
00:08:01,759 --> 00:08:02,759
Cut the chatter.

105
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:03,680
Go interrogate your guy.

106
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:04,920
Wait.

107
00:08:05,199 --> 00:08:06,318
Don't go too crazy.

108
00:08:06,319 --> 00:08:07,878
I need to see you after the interrogation.

109
00:08:07,879 --> 00:08:08,879
Got it.

110
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,959
Remember to wire the money to my account.

111
00:08:34,159 --> 00:08:35,039
Clean it up nicely.

112
00:08:35,039 --> 00:08:36,039
Uncle doesn't like a mess.

113
00:08:36,039 --> 00:08:37,039
Understood.

114
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:00,480
Thank you.

115
00:09:13,799 --> 00:09:14,799
- Uncle.
- Uncle.

116
00:09:14,895 --> 00:09:15,895
Go play over there.

117
00:09:15,919 --> 00:09:16,919
Be careful not to fall.

118
00:09:18,799 --> 00:09:19,799
Sit.

119
00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:24,720
Uncle.

120
00:09:24,879 --> 00:09:28,240
President Zhao should come begging us for
a partnership in the next couple of days.

121
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:35,600
Zhao has a big temper but little skill.

122
00:09:36,320 --> 00:09:37,600
You've been wronged.

123
00:09:37,759 --> 00:09:38,919
It's my duty, Uncle.

124
00:09:40,039 --> 00:09:42,799
I heard you found a guide.

125
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:44,919
Yes, Uncle.

126
00:09:45,639 --> 00:09:47,239
The northern route was recently blocked.

127
00:09:47,346 --> 00:09:49,056
The Black Moon Society
needs their goods urgently.

128
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:51,775
This is our first time trading with
them. We can't afford any mistakes.

129
00:09:51,799 --> 00:09:53,279
So I found a guide.

130
00:09:53,559 --> 00:09:55,440
We'll carve out a path ourselves.

131
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:57,440
If this route clears...

132
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:58,999
in all of Cangnan...

133
00:09:59,000 --> 00:09:59,759
there won't be another group...

134
00:09:59,759 --> 00:10:00,759
that can compete with us.

135
00:10:03,399 --> 00:10:04,559
You've worked hard.

136
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,319
I didn't expect...

137
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:09,320
the anti-corruption
campaign to be this massive.

138
00:10:09,799 --> 00:10:11,679
The routes we've run for years...

139
00:10:12,279 --> 00:10:13,759
are all dead ends now.

140
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:15,480
I'm getting old.

141
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:18,080
I'll have to rely on
you guys in the future.

142
00:10:23,399 --> 00:10:25,559
Who's the middleman?

143
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:28,159
His name is A-feng, one of my men.

144
00:10:29,039 --> 00:10:30,919
A-feng, I remember him.

145
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:32,639
Quite sharp.

146
00:10:32,759 --> 00:10:35,240
Just loves money a bit too much.

147
00:10:35,679 --> 00:10:36,799
Don't worry, Uncle.

148
00:10:37,399 --> 00:10:38,758
Once fed enough money...

149
00:10:38,759 --> 00:10:40,039
a dog won't bark out of turn.

150
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:43,120
A-yan.

151
00:10:44,039 --> 00:10:45,679
You tag along for this trip.

152
00:10:48,159 --> 00:10:49,159
Okay.

153
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:52,079
Uncle, this is my lead.

154
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:52,879
Your lead.

155
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:55,440
It won't hurt for family to go together.

156
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:57,119
The credit will still be yours.

157
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:58,480
But if there's a problem...

158
00:11:01,159 --> 00:11:03,000
you two share the blame equally.

159
00:11:08,679 --> 00:11:09,679
Go on back.

160
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:18,720
Come here.

161
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:23,296
You can keep an eye on things.

162
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:24,320
But the guy is mine.

163
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:25,519
Don't interfere.

164
00:11:27,919 --> 00:11:29,119
People...

165
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,960
should have fewer desires...

166
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:32,360
and more kindness.

167
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:35,639
Returning to simplicity is the true path.

168
00:11:53,559 --> 00:11:54,559
Done interrogating?

169
00:11:54,679 --> 00:11:56,359
You've made a huge contribution this time.

170
00:11:56,759 --> 00:11:57,759
That was pretty fast.

171
00:11:57,879 --> 00:11:59,559
It would've been faster if you were there.

172
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:01,560
What do you say? Consider
coming back to work?

173
00:12:01,759 --> 00:12:03,840
I can't stand the military environment.

174
00:12:04,440 --> 00:12:06,600
I'm much more comfortable and free now.

175
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:10,000
You're still hung up on that incident.

176
00:12:12,639 --> 00:12:13,719
Let's get down to business.

177
00:12:14,200 --> 00:12:15,518
Do you know why we wanted to catch...

178
00:12:15,519 --> 00:12:16,678
that info broker today?

179
00:12:16,679 --> 00:12:17,799
Stop keeping me in suspense.

180
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:19,840
You've heard of the Lin Group, right?

181
00:12:25,519 --> 00:12:26,440
Cangnan's largest...

182
00:12:26,441 --> 00:12:27,638
foreign trade conglomerate.

183
00:12:27,639 --> 00:12:28,399
Who hasn't?

184
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:29,600
It's more than that.

185
00:12:29,639 --> 00:12:31,079
They are currently Cangnan's...

186
00:12:31,080 --> 00:12:32,479
largest arms smuggling syndicate.

187
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:33,638
Their tentacles basically reach...

188
00:12:33,639 --> 00:12:34,799
all surrounding regions.

189
00:12:34,919 --> 00:12:36,199
The weapons they handle every year...

190
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:37,799
could arm a small country.

191
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:39,120
Arms dealing...

192
00:12:58,600 --> 00:12:59,759
You've probably guessed it.

193
00:13:00,039 --> 00:13:01,960
The bombing of Luoman Village back then...

194
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:03,200
was their doing.

195
00:13:03,879 --> 00:13:05,000
That kid A-kun...

196
00:13:05,799 --> 00:13:07,655
managed to hook up with
such a massive syndicate?

197
00:13:07,679 --> 00:13:08,799
That's how fate turns.

198
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:09,919
People from the Lin Group...

199
00:13:09,919 --> 00:13:10,879
contacted him recently.

200
00:13:10,879 --> 00:13:11,759
They want to buy a...

201
00:13:11,760 --> 00:13:13,320
smuggling route to the port from him.

202
00:13:13,720 --> 00:13:15,919
Sounds like a massive shipment.

203
00:13:16,320 --> 00:13:17,600
With Lin's massive business...

204
00:13:18,039 --> 00:13:19,839
they still need an info
broker to move goods?

205
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:21,000
They must be playing you.

206
00:13:21,759 --> 00:13:23,120
I thought so too at first.

207
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:24,679
But we have inside intel.

208
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:26,398
The recent anti-corruption campaign...

209
00:13:26,399 --> 00:13:27,960
has indeed hit Lin hard.

210
00:13:28,073 --> 00:13:30,833
Several routes are now dead ends
due to changes in upper management.

211
00:13:30,879 --> 00:13:32,319
It's normal to turn to anyone in a panic.

212
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:33,240
For us...

213
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:34,000
this is a great opportunity.

214
00:13:34,240 --> 00:13:35,280
What do you need me to do?

215
00:13:35,799 --> 00:13:38,440
You'll be that guide.

216
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:41,000
You're really playing them for fools.

217
00:13:41,200 --> 00:13:41,960
Don't worry.

218
00:13:41,961 --> 00:13:43,079
Our plan is airtight.

219
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:44,000
They lack a route.

220
00:13:44,001 --> 00:13:45,840
So we'll open an exclusive one up for them.

221
00:13:45,841 --> 00:13:47,839
You just need to deliver this route...

222
00:13:47,840 --> 00:13:48,840
right to them.

223
00:13:49,799 --> 00:13:51,679
How much of this route is real?

224
00:13:51,840 --> 00:13:53,000
Half real, half fake.

225
00:13:53,159 --> 00:13:54,519
It can withstand initial scrutiny.

226
00:13:55,200 --> 00:13:56,518
But a few key nodes inside...

227
00:13:56,519 --> 00:13:57,558
are under our control.

228
00:13:57,559 --> 00:13:59,119
As long as they use this route...

229
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:00,878
we can close the net at specific points.

230
00:14:00,879 --> 00:14:02,119
Catch them like rats in a trap.

231
00:14:02,440 --> 00:14:03,440
When's the meeting?

232
00:14:03,679 --> 00:14:04,679
Today.

233
00:14:04,879 --> 00:14:05,879
Today?

234
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:07,399
Why didn't you just say...

235
00:14:07,400 --> 00:14:08,480
I should go right now?

236
00:14:09,080 --> 00:14:10,919
We just got this out of the interrogation.

237
00:14:11,360 --> 00:14:12,159
Time is tight.

238
00:14:12,360 --> 00:14:13,439
I'll send you the files now.

239
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:15,000
You need to focus on three people.

240
00:14:15,559 --> 00:14:17,399
First is Black Scorpion.

241
00:14:17,840 --> 00:14:19,200
The one you'll be trading with.

242
00:14:19,399 --> 00:14:20,600
Lin Cang's right-hand man.

243
00:14:20,799 --> 00:14:21,839
He's the only one in our investigation...

244
00:14:21,840 --> 00:14:23,200
with a criminal record.

245
00:14:24,080 --> 00:14:25,039
The nightclubs in Cangnan...

246
00:14:25,040 --> 00:14:26,399
are basically all in his hands.

247
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:28,158
It was his subordinates...

248
00:14:28,159 --> 00:14:29,039
who contacted A-kun.

249
00:14:29,159 --> 00:14:29,799
Looking for a guide.

250
00:14:30,039 --> 00:14:31,039
What about the other two?

251
00:14:31,919 --> 00:14:32,919
The second one...

252
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:35,240
is the public boss of the Lin Group.

253
00:14:35,399 --> 00:14:36,399
His name is Lin Yan.

254
00:14:37,240 --> 00:14:38,719
But I don't have a photo of him.

255
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:39,720
I can only tell you...

256
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:40,759
he is a guy...

257
00:14:40,760 --> 00:14:42,360
even more dangerous than Black Scorpion.

258
00:14:43,960 --> 00:14:44,720
The third one

259
00:14:44,919 --> 00:14:47,159
is Lin Cang, the boss of the Lin Group.

260
00:14:47,600 --> 00:14:49,519
He's the source of the entire arms chain.

261
00:14:49,759 --> 00:14:51,080
But he stays deep in the shadows.

262
00:14:51,360 --> 00:14:51,919
All transactions

263
00:14:51,920 --> 00:14:53,319
are done through middlemen.

264
00:14:53,320 --> 00:14:54,799
He never shows his face in public.

265
00:14:55,080 --> 00:14:56,440
There's zero intel on him.

266
00:14:57,399 --> 00:14:58,839
You might as well have said nothing.

267
00:15:00,039 --> 00:15:01,758
At the very least, the infiltration route

268
00:15:01,759 --> 00:15:02,960
is already paved for you.

269
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:03,879
This route

270
00:15:04,080 --> 00:15:05,240
is your bargaining chip.

271
00:15:08,559 --> 00:15:09,679
What is this symbol?

272
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:11,600
Symbol?

273
00:15:13,200 --> 00:15:14,239
You mean that one?

274
00:15:14,240 --> 00:15:15,240
It looks like Lin's

275
00:15:15,241 --> 00:15:16,519
signature emblem.

276
00:15:16,879 --> 00:15:17,679
It has appeared in many

277
00:15:17,680 --> 00:15:19,240
places where Lin conducts transactions.

278
00:15:19,360 --> 00:15:21,200
But we're not entirely sure.

279
00:15:43,559 --> 00:15:44,679
Will you give this to me?

280
00:15:55,080 --> 00:15:56,200
It's you.

281
00:15:57,759 --> 00:15:59,120
How could it be you?

282
00:16:07,519 --> 00:16:08,519
Brother Scorpion.

283
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:10,000
Young Master Lin.

284
00:16:10,679 --> 00:16:11,240
Where are you going?

285
00:16:11,240 --> 00:16:12,240
You're drunk.

286
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:13,679
Didn't we have a deal?

287
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:14,679
Don't go.

288
00:16:14,680 --> 00:16:16,080
Hey gorgeous, don't leave.

289
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:17,720
Have another drink with me.

290
00:16:17,721 --> 00:16:18,879
Do you have a death wish?

291
00:16:19,639 --> 00:16:20,080
Let's go.

292
00:16:20,081 --> 00:16:21,240
Sorry about that, boss.

293
00:16:21,519 --> 00:16:22,519
Thank you.

294
00:16:23,363 --> 00:16:24,843
[New stock, accepting orders]

295
00:16:27,399 --> 00:16:28,399
You're so busy,

296
00:16:28,720 --> 00:16:29,878
you didn't have to come.

297
00:16:29,879 --> 00:16:30,879
It's nothing.

298
00:16:45,080 --> 00:16:46,800
That customer just now was really generous.

299
00:16:47,559 --> 00:16:48,559
Look.

300
00:16:49,279 --> 00:16:51,720
Hey handsome, first time here?

301
00:16:51,817 --> 00:16:53,336
Stay and have a drink with me.

302
00:16:53,360 --> 00:16:54,800
- Yeah.
- I have things to do today.

303
00:16:54,879 --> 00:16:55,879
Maybe next time.

304
00:16:56,799 --> 00:16:57,799
Alright then.

305
00:16:58,919 --> 00:17:00,320
Remember me.

306
00:17:07,400 --> 00:17:08,400
Brother.

307
00:17:10,240 --> 00:17:11,039
This way.

308
00:17:11,040 --> 00:17:12,799
Thanks for the trouble, brother.

309
00:17:15,039 --> 00:17:16,680
Which big shot is coming today?

310
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:20,359
So I can prepare myself to not say
the wrong thing and offend someone.

311
00:17:27,319 --> 00:17:29,055
Just call him Brother
Scorpion when you go in.

312
00:17:29,079 --> 00:17:29,920
Don't worry.

313
00:17:29,921 --> 00:17:31,121
As long as the route is solid,

314
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:32,720
you'll get your fair share.

315
00:17:38,319 --> 00:17:39,319
Go on in.

316
00:18:01,440 --> 00:18:02,560
Greetings, Brother Scorpion.

317
00:18:09,119 --> 00:18:10,119
Just you?

318
00:18:11,680 --> 00:18:12,680
I heard

319
00:18:12,799 --> 00:18:14,759
you can open up a route to the port.

320
00:18:15,799 --> 00:18:17,199
It's all thanks to the support

321
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:18,335
of my brothers over the years.

322
00:18:18,359 --> 00:18:19,519
I've got some favors to pull,

323
00:18:19,839 --> 00:18:21,199
so I managed to carve out a route.

324
00:18:22,480 --> 00:18:23,480
Sit.

325
00:18:24,079 --> 00:18:25,879
Doing business doesn't
have to be so serious.

326
00:18:26,119 --> 00:18:27,456
Let's play a few rounds while we talk.

327
00:18:27,480 --> 00:18:28,480
Relax.

328
00:18:29,240 --> 00:18:31,040
You think too highly
of me, Brother Scorpion.

329
00:18:31,119 --> 00:18:32,680
The little money I make

330
00:18:32,839 --> 00:18:34,119
probably can't afford this game.

331
00:18:35,319 --> 00:18:36,759
Whether you can afford it or not

332
00:18:37,319 --> 00:18:38,359
isn't up to you.

333
00:18:40,640 --> 00:18:41,799
It's up to me.

334
00:18:44,119 --> 00:18:45,480
Did you bring the route map?

335
00:18:49,640 --> 00:18:51,480
I am the route.

336
00:18:52,319 --> 00:18:53,480
Seven channels,

337
00:18:53,759 --> 00:18:55,079
three time windows.

338
00:18:55,799 --> 00:18:57,079
Who can pass through,

339
00:18:59,680 --> 00:19:00,880
it's all in my head.

340
00:19:01,839 --> 00:19:02,839
Brother Scorpion,

341
00:19:03,119 --> 00:19:04,599
how do you want to inspect the goods?

342
00:19:04,880 --> 00:19:07,039
Take a trip out there?

343
00:19:08,839 --> 00:19:09,920
No rush.

344
00:19:11,799 --> 00:19:13,039
Since we're talking business,

345
00:19:14,119 --> 00:19:15,799
let's see how your luck holds up.

346
00:19:20,119 --> 00:19:21,279
Let's play a couple of hands.

347
00:19:28,480 --> 00:19:29,719
You just said

348
00:19:29,720 --> 00:19:30,920
the route is in your head.

349
00:19:32,599 --> 00:19:34,000
Something so important,

350
00:19:35,640 --> 00:19:37,600
aren't you afraid I might
extract it another way?

351
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:41,240
How do you want to
extract it, Brother Scorpion?

352
00:19:50,559 --> 00:19:51,679
Stay here.

353
00:19:51,680 --> 00:19:53,079
Think it through before you leave.

354
00:19:54,079 --> 00:19:55,079
Brother Scorpion,

355
00:19:55,759 --> 00:19:56,960
are you trying to scare me?

356
00:19:57,480 --> 00:19:58,480
What do you think?

357
00:20:00,960 --> 00:20:03,799
A route is all about timing.

358
00:20:04,960 --> 00:20:06,440
Today it's a highway to heaven,

359
00:20:06,799 --> 00:20:08,680
tomorrow it could be the bridge to hell.

360
00:20:09,519 --> 00:20:10,160
This route,

361
00:20:10,161 --> 00:20:11,559
without me in the picture,

362
00:20:13,400 --> 00:20:14,400
is completely worthless.

363
00:20:19,799 --> 00:20:20,799
Interesting.

364
00:20:23,559 --> 00:20:25,400
That was a pretty speech you just made.

365
00:20:26,680 --> 00:20:27,880
But my friend,

366
00:20:28,039 --> 00:20:29,279
truly smart people

367
00:20:29,960 --> 00:20:31,239
usually don't let others see

368
00:20:31,240 --> 00:20:32,240
just how smart they are.

369
00:20:33,720 --> 00:20:35,519
I hate people who are too smart.

370
00:20:36,599 --> 00:20:40,399
Do you prefer fools, Brother Scorpion?

371
00:20:40,400 --> 00:20:40,880
No.

372
00:20:41,119 --> 00:20:42,359
What I like are

373
00:20:43,039 --> 00:20:44,599
smart people who obey orders.

374
00:20:46,920 --> 00:20:47,920
Point taken.

375
00:20:52,599 --> 00:20:53,599
All in.

376
00:20:57,519 --> 00:20:58,519
I call.

377
00:21:00,519 --> 00:21:01,519
Let's see them.

378
00:21:08,240 --> 00:21:10,279
Looks like luck is on my side today.

379
00:21:10,480 --> 00:21:11,279
You lose.

380
00:21:11,440 --> 00:21:12,799
I've always had bad luck.

381
00:21:14,279 --> 00:21:16,000
Bad luck?

382
00:21:16,839 --> 00:21:18,920
You have bad luck and you still call?

383
00:21:19,839 --> 00:21:20,839
What are you after?

384
00:21:23,799 --> 00:21:24,799
Money.

385
00:21:29,279 --> 00:21:30,480
What a coincidence.

386
00:21:52,880 --> 00:21:54,119
I'm after money too.

387
00:21:54,799 --> 00:21:56,119
Including your share.

388
00:21:56,440 --> 00:21:57,559
Brother Scorpion,

389
00:21:57,960 --> 00:21:59,080
what is the meaning of this?

390
00:21:59,440 --> 00:22:01,240
Leave the route behind,

391
00:22:02,279 --> 00:22:05,400
and your life too.

392
00:22:06,200 --> 00:22:07,680
Have mercy, Brother Scorpion!

393
00:22:08,759 --> 00:22:09,640
You're asking for it!

394
00:22:09,641 --> 00:22:10,881
Don't move. Put the knife down.

395
00:22:12,680 --> 00:22:13,680
Did you think

396
00:22:13,799 --> 00:22:15,079
you could make it out alive?

397
00:22:15,799 --> 00:22:17,159
That depends on whose side

398
00:22:17,160 --> 00:22:18,559
luck is on today.

399
00:22:30,025 --> 00:22:31,025
I'm here.

400
00:22:31,599 --> 00:22:33,160
You're not leaving that easily.
